@page
@model Portfolio.Pages.ContactModel
@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Contact"; }
<header class="page-header"><p class="page-kicker"><i class="bi bi-chat-dots" aria-hidden="true"></i> Product delivery &amp; engineering</p><h1>Contact</h1><p class="page-intro">Build reliable products with practical architecture and hands-on engineering.</p></header>
<div class="reading-layout"><div class="reading-main"><p>The contact form is not currently available. Connect through LinkedIn about product development and engineering leadership, or explore my implementation work on GitHub.</p>
<div class="project-grid"><section class="project-card"><h2>LinkedIn</h2><p>Professional experience and connections.</p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/michael-carey-13899627/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a></section>
<section class="project-card"><h2>GitHub</h2><p>Repositories and hands-on engineering work.</p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://github.com/MCLifeLeader" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a></section></div></div>
<aside class="reading-aside"><section class="content-panel"><h2>Explore further</h2><ul class="resource-list"><li><a asp-page="/Architecture">Architecture &amp; Governance</a></li><li><a asp-page="/Experience/WorkHistory">Work history</a></li><li><a asp-page="/AboutMe" asp-fragment="connections">More connections</a></li></ul></section></aside></div>
